<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-ZUELLE WINS TOUR OF SPAIN.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ZUELLE WINS TOUR OF SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex Zuelle of Switzerland won the Tour of Spain on Sunday.</p>
<p>Fellow Swiss Laurent Dufaux and Tony Rominger, finished second and third respectively.</p>
